[en.FOCUS_C15_INDEPENDENCE_WAR_THEOLOGY]
The Source of Calamity

[en.FOCUS_C15_INDEPENDENCE_WAR_THEOLOGY_desc]
In a solemn proclamation, Flurry Heart claimed to have heard the voice of the Crystal Heart, issuing a warning to all forces seeking to intervene or exert control over the Crystal Empire. The Crystal Heart demanded an immediate restoration of all freedoms to the citizens of the Crystal Empire, lest ten calamities befall as punishment: the Plague of Bloodlights, the Siege of Timberwolves, the Swarm of Parasprites, the Pestilence Plague, the Petrifying Gaze, the Tempest of Windigos, the Swarm of Bugbears, the Veil of Shadows, and the Curse of the Firstborn.\nWith an overwhelming majority, the Crystal Empire Council passed a proposal to abide by the will of the Crystal Heart. They have formally delivered an ultimatum, or rather a declaration of war: while the Crystal Empire only declared independence, the open breach of the Pact is tantamount to forcing the Changeling Empire to declare war on the Crystal Empire.

[en.FOCUS_C15_INDEPENDENCE_WAR_THEOLOGY_TOOLTIP]
We need at least §Y350§! seats to support us, currently we have: [?C15.C15_full_support|Y0].\nOr, we need to have more than §Y300§! seats ourselves, currently we have: [?C15.parliament_seat_array^1|Y0].\nMeanwhile, we need to have less than §Y65§! seats for changelings, currently they have: [?C15.parliament_seat_array^4|Y0].

[zh.FOCUS_C15_INDEPENDENCE_WAR_THEOLOGY]
灾祸之源

[zh.FOCUS_C15_INDEPENDENCE_WAR_THEOLOGY_desc]
风雪之心宣称聆听到了来自水晶之心的声音：水晶之心警告一切干预和妄图控制水晶帝国的势力，立即归还水晶帝国子民的一切自由，否则将降下十灾作为惩罚：血光灾、木狼灾、飞蝇灾、瘟疫灾、石像灾、风魔灾、蜂熊灾、黑暗灾、长子灾。\n水晶帝国理事会以绝对多数票通过了遵循水晶之心意志的提案，并向幻形灵帝国与小马利亚帝国提交了正式的最后通牒，或者说，一份实质上的宣战书：虽然水晶帝国只是宣布了独立，但这对《协定》的公然撕毁，几乎等价于强迫幻形灵帝国对水晶帝国宣战。

[zh.FOCUS_C15_INDEPENDENCE_WAR_THEOLOGY_TOOLTIP]
我们需要至少 §Y350§! 席位的支持，目前的支持票：[?C15.C15_full_support|Y0]。\n或者，我们需要自身拥有超过 §Y300§! 席位，目前的席位：[?C15.parliament_seat_array^1|Y0]。\n与此同时，我们需要幻形灵的席位少于 §Y65§!，目前的席位：[?C15.parliament_seat_array^4|Y0]。

